cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite both the software and the report below."
title: AuthBench
abstract: >-
  An open harness that evaluates authentication anomaly detectors under a temporally
  leak-free protocol and daily alert budgets: it ranks events, edge-hours and user-days
  within each day, gives every red-team campaign the daily budget at which it is first
  detected, and sets each result against its exact distribution under a random ranking and
  against label-free activity rankings of the same units.
